---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SORIE™ Methodology — Blue Unicorn"
  description="Real Solutions for Extraordinary Ideas. Discover the SORIE™ methodology from Blue Unicorn: Strategy, Opportunity, Reality, Innovation, Execution."
  showHeader={true}
>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
HERO — SORIE™
midnight #0A1628
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section class="relative overflow-hidden md:min-h-[60dvh] flex items-center" style="background: linear-gradient(to bottom, #0F2548, #163667, #0B4F7A, #00698D, #0088B3);">

  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-20 md:py-28 text-center" data-reveal>
    <h1 class="reveal-item leading-[0.92] tracking-tight mb-6" style="--i:0;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(3rem,9vw,6rem);">
      SORIE&trade;
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal-item text-lg md:text-xl max-w-[48ch] mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="--i:1;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
      Real Solutions for Extraordinary Ideas. How we take an idea to something that actually exists — no shortcuts, no formulas.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
ORIGIN — human, not intimate
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#FFFFFF;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-20 text-center">
    <p class="reveal-item text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold leading-snug tracking-tight text-balance" style="--i:0;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">
      SORIE&trade; didn't come out of a workshop. It was shaped project after project — in factories, customs, marketplaces, and real campaigns.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
LETTERS S O R I E — Bilingual, same as index
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#FFFFFF;" data-sorie-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-10 md:pb-14">

    <div class="flex flex-nowrap items-end justify-center gap-2.5 md:gap-12 lg:gap-20">

      <!-- S — Strategy / Estrategia -->
      <div class="sorie-col flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0" style="--i:0">
        <span class="text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #0F2548;">S</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #0F2548;">Strategy</span>
        <span class="text-[8px] md:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide opacity-40 whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #0F2548;">Estrategia</span>
      </div>

      <!-- O — Opportunity / Oportunidad -->
      <div class="sorie-col flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0" style="--i:1">
        <span class="text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #163667;">O</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #163667;">Opportunity</span>
        <span class="text-[8px] md:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide opacity-40 whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #163667;">Oportunidad</span>
      </div>

      <!-- R — Reality / Realidad -->
      <div class="sorie-col flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0" style="--i:2">
        <span class="text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #0B4F7A;">R</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #0B4F7A;">Reality</span>
        <span class="text-[8px] md:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide opacity-40 whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #0B4F7A;">Realidad</span>
      </div>

      <!-- I — Innovation / Innovación -->
      <div class="sorie-col flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0" style="--i:3">
        <span class="text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #00698D;">I</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #00698D;">Innovation</span>
        <span class="text-[8px] md:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide opacity-40 whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #00698D;">Innovación</span>
      </div>

      <!-- E — Execution / Ejecución -->
      <div class="sorie-col flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0" style="--i:4">
        <span class="text-5xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; color: #0088B3;">E</span>
        <span class="text-[10px] md:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #0088B3;">Execution</span>
        <span class="text-[8px] md:text-xs font-medium tracking-wide opacity-40 whitespace-nowrap" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #0088B3;">Ejecución</span>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Slogan -->
    <div class="text-center pt-12 pb-4">
      <p class="sorie-slogan text-lg md:text-xl font-semibold italic opacity-70 tracking-wide" style="font-family: 'Satoshi', sans-serif; color: #163667;">
        Real Solutions for Extraordinary Ideas
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
WHAT EACH LETTER MEANS — Explanation
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#F2F5F8;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-28">

    <div class="space-y-10 md:space-y-16">

      <!-- S -->
      <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start" style="--i:0">
        <div class="shrink-0">
          <span class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">S</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">Strategy &mdash; Estrategia</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
            We look at the whole idea before moving a piece: what you want to build, whether it makes sense now, and the clearest path to get there.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- O -->
      <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start" style="--i:1">
        <div class="shrink-0">
          <span class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">O</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">Opportunity &mdash; Oportunidad</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
            We look for where that idea can truly grow: market, people, channels and margin. Not every idea is an opportunity — and it's better to know early.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- R -->
      <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start" style="--i:2">
        <div class="shrink-0">
          <span class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0B4F7A;">R</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0B4F7A;">Reality &mdash; Realidad</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
            We bring the idea down to earth: product, costs, suppliers and how it runs day to day. If it can't be sustained, it's not worth building.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- I -->
      <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start" style="--i:3">
        <div class="shrink-0">
          <span class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#00698D;">I</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#00698D;">Innovation &mdash; Innovación</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
            We give it its own shape: brand, product, message and detail. So the idea doesn't look like everyone else's — and it shows.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- E -->
      <div class="reveal-item flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 md:gap-10 items-start" style="--i:4">
        <div class="shrink-0">
          <span class="text-6xl md:text-7xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0088B3;">E</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0088B3;">Execution &mdash; Ejecución</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
            We put it in motion for real: we coordinate, launch and stay with it until the idea stops being a plan and starts living in the market.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
AUTHORITY QUOTE
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#FFFFFF;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-14 md:pt-24 pb-10 md:pb-16 text-center">
    <img src="/images/logo-marino.png" alt="Blue Unicorn" class="reveal-item h-8 w-auto mx-auto mb-5 opacity-50" style="--i:0" />
    <blockquote class="reveal-item text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-[1.2] tracking-tight" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">
      &ldquo;A unicorn is that extraordinary opportunity that almost no one manages to find... but some manage to build.&rdquo;
    </blockquote>
    <p class="reveal-item mt-4 text-base opacity-50" style="--i:2;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#6B7280;">— Luis Chicharro · Brands Developer</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
WHY SORIE™
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#F5F1EC;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto md:px-12 py-14 md:py-24">

    <div class="reveal-item px-6 md:px-0 text-center mb-10 md:mb-20" style="--i:0">
      <h2 class="text-[2.5rem] md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">Why SORIE&trade;</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-[40ch] mx-auto leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#6B7280;">
        It's not a pretty acronym. It's the structure we learned through trial, error, success, and repetition.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="md:hidden overflow-hidden w-full" data-bloque-rail data-bloque-x>
      <div class="flex gap-3 overflow-x-auto snap-x snap-mandatory" data-bloque-scroller style="scrollbar-width:none; -ms-overflow-style:none; padding-left:24px; padding-right:24px; scroll-padding-left:24px; scroll-padding-right:24px;">

        <div class="snap-start shrink-0 w-[82vw] max-w-[360px] flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 rounded-xl" data-bloque-item style="--c:#0F2548;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(15,37,72,0.06);">
          <span class="bloque-num block text-6xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">01</span>
          <h3 class="bloque-title text-xl font-bold leading-tight" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">Born from the ground, not from a manual</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">SORIE™ wasn't designed on a whiteboard. It was shaped project after project, in factories, in customs, in marketplaces, and in real campaigns. Each letter represents a phase we've lived through dozens of times.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="snap-start shrink-0 w-[82vw] max-w-[360px] flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 rounded-xl" data-bloque-item style="--c:#163667;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(22,54,103,0.06);">
          <span class="bloque-num block text-6xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">02</span>
          <h3 class="bloque-title text-xl font-bold leading-tight" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">Connects strategy and execution</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">Many methodologies stay on paper. SORIE™ goes from idea to action without gaps: what gets decided gets done, and what gets done gets learned. No cracks between the plan and reality.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="snap-start shrink-0 w-[82vw] max-w-[360px] flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 rounded-xl" data-bloque-item style="--c:#0B4F7A;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(11,79,122,0.06);">
          <span class="bloque-num block text-6xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">03</span>
          <h3 class="bloque-title text-xl font-bold leading-tight" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0B4F7A;">It adapts, it doesn't impose</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">Not every project needs the same thing. Some start with O (because they already have strategy), others only need I and E. SORIE™ is a framework, not a straitjacket. It's applied where it adds value.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="snap-start shrink-0 w-[82vw] max-w-[360px] flex flex-col gap-3 p-5 rounded-xl" data-bloque-item style="--c:#00698D;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid rgba(0,105,141,0.06);">
          <span class="bloque-num block text-6xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">04</span>
          <h3 class="bloque-title text-xl font-bold leading-tight" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#00698D;">Results, not PowerPoints</h3>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">At the end of the day, the only thing that matters is whether that extraordinary idea reaches the market and holds up. SORIE™ exists for that: so ideas become real products, and products become something that grows.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="sorie-dots" class="md:hidden flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mt-5" data-bloque-dots>
      <span class="block w-2 h-2 rounded-full" data-color="#0F2548" style="background:#0F2548;opacity:1;"></span>
      <span class="block w-2 h-2 rounded-full" data-color="#163667" style="background:#163667;opacity:0.22;"></span>
      <span class="block w-2 h-2 rounded-full" data-color="#0B4F7A" style="background:#0B4F7A;opacity:0.22;"></span>
      <span class="block w-2 h-2 rounded-full" data-color="#00698D" style="background:#00698D;opacity:0.22;"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="hidden md:grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 px-12" data-bloque-rail>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8" data-bloque-item style="--c:#0F2548;">
        <span class="bloque-num text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">01</span>
        <h3 class="bloque-title mt-3 text-xl font-bold" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">Born from the ground, not from a manual</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#4B5563;">
          SORIE™ wasn't designed on a whiteboard. It was shaped project after project, in factories, in customs, in marketplaces, and in real campaigns. Each letter represents a phase we've lived through dozens of times.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8" data-bloque-item style="--c:#163667;">
        <span class="bloque-num text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">02</span>
        <h3 class="bloque-title mt-3 text-xl font-bold" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">Connects strategy and execution</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#4B5563;">
          Many methodologies stay on paper. SORIE™ goes from idea to action without gaps: what gets decided gets done, and what gets done gets learned. No cracks between the plan and reality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8" data-bloque-item style="--c:#0B4F7A;">
        <span class="bloque-num text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">03</span>
        <h3 class="bloque-title mt-3 text-xl font-bold" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0B4F7A;">It adapts, it doesn't impose</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#4B5563;">
          Not every project needs the same thing. Some start with O (because they already have strategy), others only need I and E. SORIE™ is a framework, not a straitjacket. It's applied where it adds value.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-6 md:p-8" data-bloque-item style="--c:#00698D;">
        <span class="bloque-num text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">04</span>
        <h3 class="bloque-title mt-3 text-xl font-bold" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#00698D;">Results, not PowerPoints</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#4B5563;">
          At the end of the day, the only thing that matters is whether that extraordinary idea reaches the market and holds up. SORIE™ exists for that: so ideas become real products, and products become something that grows.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
WHAT SORIE™ IS NOT / WHAT IT IS
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#FFFFFF;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-24">
    <span class="reveal-item text-[11px] tracking-[0.35em] uppercase font-semibold opacity-35" style="--i:0;color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Criteria</span>
    <h2 class="reveal-item mt-4 text-[2rem] md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1]" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">
      What SORIE&trade; is not.<br>What it is.
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-10 md:mt-14 space-y-8 md:space-y-10">
      <div class="reveal-item grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-8" style="--i:2">
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-snug" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#9CA3AF;">Not a straitjacket</p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-snug font-medium" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">It adapts to what each idea needs</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal-item grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-8" style="--i:3;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,37,72,0.08);padding-top:2rem;">
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-snug" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#9CA3AF;">It doesn't stay on paper</p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-snug font-medium" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">It connects strategy with real execution</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal-item grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-8" style="--i:4;border-top:1px solid rgba(15,37,72,0.08);padding-top:2rem;">
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-snug" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#9CA3AF;">Not a marketing acronym</p>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg leading-snug font-medium" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">The way we build extraordinary ideas</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════
FAQ — SORIE™
═════════════════════════════════════════ -->
<section style="background:#F2F5F8;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-2 pb-12 md:pt-4 md:pb-24">

    <div class="space-y-1" id="faq-accordion">

      <div class="reveal-item faq-item border-b" style="--i:0;border-color:rgba(22,54,103,0.08);">
        <button class="faq-trigger flex items-center justify-between w-full py-5 cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold pr-6 text-left" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">Is SORIE™ a rigid methodology?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon shrink-0 text-xl leading-none" style="color:#163667;transition:transform 0.4s ease;">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content" style="max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.45s ease;">
          <div>
            <p class="pb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
              No. SORIE™ is a framework, not a straitjacket. Each project has its own starting point. Some need to begin with E (execution), others with S (solutions). We apply it where it genuinely adds value, without repeating steps that are already covered.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal-item faq-item border-b" style="--i:1;border-color:rgba(22,54,103,0.08);">
        <button class="faq-trigger flex items-center justify-between w-full py-5 cursor-pointer bg-transparent border-none" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="text-lg font-semibold pr-6 text-left" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">How is it different from other methodologies?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon shrink-0 text-xl leading-none" style="color:#163667;transition:transform 0.4s ease;">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-content" style="max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.45s ease;">
          <div>
            <p class="pb-5 text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;">
